{# MY LEAVE (#19; design variants-my-dashboard/a.html, the My leave card) — my absences
   this year, each with its days, and how many days of the year they cover.

   NO ALLOWANCE, NO APPROVAL AND NO WAY TO ASK. The roster records an
   absence because the hole it makes is the roster's to show; what somebody
   is entitled to, whether it was approved and how to ask belong to Team,
   which owns the person's employment. So the design's "Days left" row, its
   approval chip and its "Ask for leave" door are not drawn, and the foot
   says why rather than printing a number nobody keeps. #}
{% import '@UhifadhiRoster/me/_dates.html.twig' as dates %}
<div class="c" data-me="leave"><span class="tab">My leave<span class="src">&middot; {{ leave.year }}</span></span>
    {% for absence in leave.absences %}
        {% set days = absence.startsOn.diff(absence.endsOn).days + 1 %}
        <div class="rln"><span>{{ absence.kind.label }}</span><span class="mono d">{{ dates.span(absence.startsOn, absence.endsOn) }} &middot; {{ days }} day{{ days == 1 ? '' : 's' }}</span></div>
    {% else %}
        <div class="rln"><span class="d">No absence this year.</span><span class="mono d"></span></div>
    {% endfor %}
    {% if leave.absences is not empty %}<div class="rln"><span>Days away</span><span class="mono d">{{ leave.daysAway }} this year</span></div>{% endif %}
    <div class="sxfoot"><span>no leave allowance is kept on the roster</span></div>
</div>
